  "description": "Mu-yeong may have been born a servant, but he dedicated his life to mastering his own unique art—until it was ruthlessly stolen by the Young Master, Hwang Hwi. Framed as a thief for allegedly stealing the Young Master's paintings, Mu-yeong is stripped of everything. Now, to reclaim his stolen identity, he vows a bloody revenge against the corrupt establishment of the Orthodox Faction.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=852506), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14425783)",
